3. Spawns all agents in group
4. Executes group workflow
5. Tracks performance

Next Task: "Create another landing page"
System:
1. Finds same group (usage_count higher now)
2. Reuses existing agents if still active
3. Executes faster

Over time:
- Groups evolve (v1 → v2 → v3)
- Best performing groups rise to top
- Groups can fork and specialize


